# Claude credentials. Set ONE of the two below.
# If both are set the API key wins, matching the SDK's own precedence.

# 1. API key — what production uses.
#    Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# 2. OAuth access token — for local development only.
#    Mint one with:  ant auth print-credentials --access-token
#    Sent as `Authorization: Bearer`, with the oauth-2025-04-20 beta flag.
#    Short-lived, so expect to refresh it. docs/01-product.md settled that a
#    personal Claude subscription can't serve other users, so this is a dev
#    convenience, not a deployment option.
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=

# Optional. Defaults to claude-sonnet-5 if unset.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# docsvc — the file pipeline (services/docsvc).
# DOCSVC_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Unset DOCSVC_TOKEN leaves docsvc open, which is fine locally and never in
# production.
# DOCSVC_TOKEN=
